#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Mutation testing: break the code on purpose, the named tests must fail.
Usage: python3 tools/mutate.py [filter]      (env WB_SHARD=i/n runs every n-th mutant, for parallel runs in copies of the tree;
                                              env WB_FROM=k skips the first k mutants, WB_TO=k stops before mutant k;
                                              env WB_LABELS=file runs exactly the mutants whose labels are listed in that file)
Every mutant is restored afterwards; a mutant whose pattern no longer matches is listed as 'unusable'."""
